.net/664da99f/uploads/origins/af2c9fca-5b4f-4297-b0e6-89f8a180b7a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=39da07f6a2c2fb02d6686bd8e9d7ca76, https://si.imgix.net/664da99f/uploads/origins/af2c9fca-5b4f-4297-b0e6-89f8a180b7a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=088f4e4bd7e4431e497de29af0c3b8b9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/664da99f/uploads/origins/af2c9fca-5b4f-4297-b0e6-89f8a180b7a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=12446672b8f1e11b5f1ced4f32108e79 3x"}, "body": "Hello sensei! Your art style is so beautiful and elegant. I hope I can request a drawing of my OC.\n\nBASIL (29):\n- A high-ranking bodyguard in a security firm. He was once a low-level lackey, but he survived many fights and outlived all of his superiors.\n- Prideful, mistrusting, and stubborn. In public, he has a calm and confident demeanor, but in private, he is paranoid, easily frustrated, and insecure. He acts coldly towards his teammates, keeping them at a distance out of fear of being betrayed.\n- His hand, fingers, and teeth were cut off by an enemy. He replaced them with gold to show that he is proud of surviving. Deep down, however, he is afraid that his injuries make him weaker than other people.\n- He is a boxer. When he gets frustrated with work, he goes to bars and picks fights with people to let off steam.\n\nMotifs: gold, spilled paint, paper money, whiskey glasses; the pawn chess piece turning into the queen chess piece\n\nFeel free to change his clothes. Thank you for considering my request! \u0669(\uff61\u2022\u0301\u203f\u2022\u0300\uff61)\u06f6\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vt9WIIJWEOUJvp1AsR1iHjflF9SceJ8U?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hanao_hn/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped"